<topic id="shapemap">
  <title>Profiling shape: nested map references</title>
  <body>
    <p>The conflict is in the map: this topic is referenced with audience="expert"
      inside a group that is audience="novice" (R023).</p>
    <!-- control: "admin" is not in the preference list, so Oxygen reports it; the value
         also overlaps the cascaded "novice", so it is no conflict -->
    <p audience="novice admin">control</p>
  </body>
